{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1789848982, "title": "Pyvider linting \u2014 OpenTofu demonstration", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.5, "o", "\u001b[1;36m$ soup lint tests/e2e/provider-linting/lint.soup.toml --provider \"$PYVIDER_CONFORMANCE_PSP\" --opentofu \"$PYVIDER_OPENTOFU_BINARY\" --lane opentofu\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.5, "o", "Direct provider validation: not requested\r\nOpenTofu native linting: valid\r\n  warning: Experimental linting enabled\r\n  warning: Directory permissions are world-writable (provide-io/pyvider:world-writable-directory)\r\n  warning: Lease lifetime exceeds one hour (provide-io/pyvider:long-lived-lease)\r\n  warning: TLS certificate verification is disabled (provide-io/pyvider:insecure-tls)\r\n  warning: HTTP API uses an unencrypted connection (provide-io/pyvider:insecure-http)\r\nOpenTofu coverage is separate from direct provider coverage.\r\n"]
